and perhaps a couple more -- mu-rhythm conditioning,
visually evoked potential (VEP) and induced lateral
orientation of attention (ILOA)...
But before anyone gets too excited -- I've not found
ANYONE who is experimenting, suggesting or even
contemplating the reading of nor the control of
